{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"综合能源","country":"日本","country_iso":"JPN","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:13:36.300764","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"JPN-HB-0002","ldc":"No","location":"南部","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"日本光伏加储能微电网项目","project_name_en":"Japan PV + BESS Microgrid Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"晶科能源","content":"近日，晶科能源为日本南部的 \"光伏加储能微电网\" 项目提供的5.24MW/15MWh的储能系统已经完工。\n该项目由晶科能源Tiger Neo N型TOPCon光伏组件发电，配合晶科能源的72台旗舰型海豚SunGiga液冷储能系统，可在2小时内提供高达15MWh的电量。这将使光伏设施产生的多余电力能够在需求旺盛时被存储和释放。该系统还将提供电网稳定服务和备用应急功能，以确保供电安全。\n在选择理想的工商业储能系统时，盈利能力、安全性、集成度以及运行和维护（O&M）成本始终是投资者关注的主要问题。海豚SunGiga专为 215kWh主流市场设计，可用于2小时和4小时充放电应用场景。SunGiga经过预调试，预安装，所有参数在离开生产基地前均已设定，从而减少了现场调试时间，保证了项目业主的早期收益。","content_sha256":"d36b68cb6bf9e63bf9e405066e512edd1512ae24f6842a65be6d2aab890182ea","id":7174,"publish_date":"2024-08-21 09:40:49","title":"晶科日本光伏加储能15MWh储能系统正式完工","title_sha256":"0a689afa7f854407a725674083db4713347473a6697b2a1ba0ca1f9fe59a3c62","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/70248.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"JPN-HB-0002","capacity_details":"PV: 5.24MW, BESS: 15MWh","capacity_mw":5.24,"capacity_mw_raw":"5.24","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:13:36.301341","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"JPN-HB-0002-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.jinkosolar.com/site/newsdetail/2066\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"晶科能源股份有限公司","project_developer_en":"JinkoSolar","project_stage":"竣工","project_summary":"晶科能源在日本南部为“光伏加储能微电网”项目提供了5.24MW光伏组件和15MW